        <h3>ESP RZK-I</h3>
        <br />
        <label>Richard owns since 2005 an ESP signature guitar. The first version is available in "Titanium" finish and then in the 2009 Musikmesse in Frankfurt are presented two new colors, "Olympic White" and "Satin Black". It is used in drop C during the Reise, Reise tour, then in standard thuning, drop C or drop D sur le LIFAD tour.</label>
        <div style="text-align: center">
            <img src="Assets/Imgs/Equipment/esp-rzk-1-olympic-white.png" />
            <br />
            <img src="Assets/Imgs/Equipment/esp-rzk-1-satin-black.png" />
            <br />
            <img src="Assets/Imgs/Equipment/esp-rzk-1-titanium.png" />
        </div>
