        <h3>ESP RZK-II</h3>
        <br />
        <label>The RZK-II marks the revival of the Richard signatures. Only the "Burnt" finish is marketed, but Richard has a "Titanium" finish that can be seen in the Pussy video.</label>
        <div style="text-align: center">
            <img src="Assets/Imgs/Equipment/esp-rzk-2-burnt.png" />
        </div>
        <label>Specifications are the same as those of RZK-I but the scale has a length of 24,76" instead of 25,5".</label>
        <br />
        <br />
